#: desc: A SUB label wins over DSUB with A:1; an anchor with SUB values but no label is still renamed
-v COLOR=0 -v SUB='$(OUT_DIR)/a:first:;$(OUT_DIR)/b:v1 v2' -v DSUB='<A:1>$(OUT_DIR):out' test/fixtures/Makefile.dsub-names
#: stdout
------------------
Available targets:
------------------
first       Write out/a
out/b       Write b (after out/a)
            v1
            v2
plain       A target without the variable in its name

------------------
Variables:
------------------
out_FLAGS   Flags used for the files in out
------------------
